<!--
  Incident glyph: HAZARD — exclamation mark in a triangle.

  This is the CATCH-ALL category: the Trafikverket importer falls back to
  'hazard' for any message code it does not recognise, so this is the most
  frequently drawn glyph and has to read as a generic "something on the road"
  rather than any specific event.

  Tinted at runtime (see IncidentMarkerStyle.glyphColorArgb).
-->
